  "items": [
    {
      "name": "Acts of Faith",
      "type": "trait",
      "_id": "adeptusActor27It",
      "img": "modules/impmal-core/assets/icons/blank.webp",
      "system": {
        "notes": {
          "player": "",
          "gm": "<p>The Canoness should benefit from 1d5-1 (to a minimum of 1) Faith Talent from the Talents Expanded supplement. Suggestions include Aegis of the Emperor, Bolstering Purity, Divine Guidance, Divine Vengeance, Furious Zeal, etc.  Deny the Witch: When a psyker within Medium Range of the Battle Sister Manifests a power, they may use their Reaction to attempt to disrupt it. The Battle Sister makes a Willpower Test with the same Difficulty as the Psychic Power. If they succeed, subtract their SL from the psyker's SL. This may reduce their SL below 1 and cause the psychic power to fail.   Disciple of the Holy Trinity: The Battle Sister gains +1SL on Ranged Attacks using Bolt, Flamer, and Melta weapons.  Truest Faith: The Battle Sister has 2 points of Fate.  War Hymn: The Sister Dogmata makes a Presence (Leadership) Test as an Action to intone a Hymn of Battle. If they succeed, they may choose an ally that can hear them from the Ecclesiarchy Faction. The next time that ally makes a melee attack, they may make a second melee attack.</p>"
        },
